# Chamfer edges (an extension): New Group > Chamfer Edges with a face
# selected says what to select; with two top edges of the extrusion of
# path_extrude picked, they are cut at 1 mm. The screen lists the edges
# and takes a new distance, here an expression.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 290 265
down L 290 265
up L 290 265
answer ok
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
key esc
move 382.5 232.5
down L 382.5 232.5
up L 382.5 232.5
move 247.5 202.5
down L 247.5 202.5
up L 247.5 202.5
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 186 125
twdown L 186 125
twup L 186 125
edit 1+1
tw
answer ok
